{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_1_level_main_01-03_beg",
  "groupId": "main_1",
  "stageId": "main_01-03",
  "title": "狂奔",
  "storyCode": "1-3",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "468646b153f38ec2e3cf8c689462979b58cdea1141e1e453263278694dd58fe7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第八关（前）\n時間未知 \\ 天氣未知 \\ 能見度 低\n切爾諾伯格 行動組E0所在地\nDr.{@nickname}營救行動 第三階段"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "還剩不到一個小時，沒時間從其他區域繞行了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "我們浪費的時間越多，天災在我們頭頂發生的可能性就越大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "必須直接穿過當前區域。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "以我們現在的規模，團隊行動難免會被發覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "在狹窄的街巷中行動，很容易被埋伏包夾......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "text": "怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "選擇不多......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，你的想法呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "正面碾壓過去就好！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜賓",
              "text": "整合運動的個人實力並不能和我們相提並論。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜賓",
              "text": "大多數情況下，都只是在依賴人海戰術圍攻我們。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "臨光",
              "text": "依靠速度，不斷前進，儘量減少一次性交戰的人數的話——",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......大概，他們也沒法阻攔......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜賓",
              "text": "他們並沒有構築防禦工事。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "臨光",
              "text": "如果我們突襲他們的封鎖線......",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜賓",
              "text": "雖然看上去人數眾多，但整合運動這樣鬆散的佈置，是攔不住我們的。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "敵人想組織反擊也需要時間。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜賓",
              "text": "整合運動的通訊方式，從過往的戰鬥來看，是十分原始的。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "臨光",
              "text": "在我們突破敵人的阻礙，當他們開始組織起來，嘗試截擊我們的時候......",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜賓",
              "text": "當整合運動終於集結完畢，我們也早已經到達了下一個區域。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "臨光",
              "text": "不錯。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "臨光",
              "text": "猛烈衝擊，攪亂陣形，破壞火力點，迅速撤退。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "臨光",
              "text": "......杜賓，你在考驗我，還是在考驗——",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜賓",
              "text": "肉眼可見的威脅遠比進退兩難容易處理得多。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜賓",
              "text": "我可以把這看作是Dr.{@nickname}的命令嗎，阿米婭？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "局勢很明瞭了。我相信博士的選擇......",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜賓",
              "text": "——所謂信任，也不光是一場戰役就能輕鬆建立的。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜賓",
              "text": "我很看好Dr.{@nickname}，但阿米婭......",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜賓",
              "text": "不要放鬆警惕。你當然可以借助博士的智慧，但不可以完全依賴他。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "——我知道。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜賓",
              "text": "別介意，博士，我沒想刁難你。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜賓",
              "text": "只是，希望你能理解——阿米婭需要更多的學習和成長。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜賓",
              "text": "站在我的立場上，你也不會允許阿米婭太依靠別人的。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜賓",
              "text": "不過，我已經認可了你的指揮能力。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "謝謝......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "text": "也別那麼拘謹，我們可已經是共患難的戰友了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "text": "至少在戰場，我的生命，已經交給你了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "text": "閒談到此為止，抓緊時間。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "臨光",
          "text": "是的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "臨光",
          "text": "卡西米爾有句諺語：“喘息時，死亡就會追上你。”",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
